WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:49.291
<b>In the previous verse, Krishna explained</b>

2
00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:52.958
<b>that the most dire situation is that of doubt.</b>

3
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:56.958
<b>Now in these final two verses</b>
<b>of the fourth chapter,</b>

4
00:00:56.958 --> 00:01:02.125
<b>Krishna explains how to destroy doubt.</b>

5
00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:11.208
<b>In these two verses of the</b>
<b>fourth chapter, Krishna explains</b>

6
00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:14.625
<b>that actions performed according </b>
<b>to spiritual knowledge</b>

7
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:18.041
<b>keep one free from the bonds of good and evil.</b>

8
00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:25.500
<b>He also emphasizes destroying the </b>
<b>doubt born of ignorance.</b>

9
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.375
<b>In the forty-first verse of the fourth chapter,</b>

10
00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:32.500
<b>Lord Krishna emphasizes the importance </b>
<b>of knowledge and action, He says .. </b>

11
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:39.875
<b>that one who has selflessly dedicated all the</b>
<b>fruits of their actions to Him with devotion,</b>

12
00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:45.666
<b>and who has dispelled the doubts in </b>
<b>their mind with divine spiritual knowledge –</b>

13
00:01:45.666 --> 00:01:50.041
<b>that person alone recognizes </b>
<b>their true spiritual self.</b>

14
00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:54.583
<b>That person knows their true form is the soul,</b>

15
00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:56.666
<b>not this material body.</b>

16
00:01:56.666 --> 00:02:01.041
<b>That person also knows that every </b>
<b>action done in service to Krishna</b>

17
00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:05.333
<b>will free them from all the</b>
<b>contrary effects of actions.</b>

18
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:09.833
<b>If we act with awareness of spiritual knowledge,</b>

19
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:12.291
<b>rather than being bound by their fruits,</b>

20
00:02:12.291 --> 00:02:16.041
<b>those very actions lead us</b>
<b>towards self-realization.</b>

21
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:19.083
<b>Then in the final verse of the fourth chapter,</b>

22
00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:26.583
<b>Krishna tells Arjuna that whatever doubts </b>
<b>have arisen in his heart due to ignorance,</b>

23
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:30.541
<b>use the sword of divine knowledge </b>
<b>to cut and destroy them.</b>

24
00:02:30.541 --> 00:02:36.916
<b>And then, situated in selfless Karma Yoga, </b>
<b>rise up for this battle.</b>

25
00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:40.791
<b>Krishna had told Arjuna to rise and fight before,</b>

26
00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:43.458
<b>but the situation here is a bit different.</b>

27
00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:47.000
<b>Here He is telling Arjuna that with the </b>
<b>understanding of spiritual knowledge,</b>

28
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.750
<b>consider the battle itself as his </b>
<b>selfless Karma Yoga.</b>

29
00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:55.500
<b>Arjuna is a Kshatriya, and battle is his duty.</b>

30
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.333
<b>If Arjuna fights this war without any selfish desire,</b>

31
00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:05.000
<b>and with the faith to dedicate all </b>
<b>the results of this war to Krishna, </b>

32
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.083
<b>then this itself will be his selfless Karma Yoga,</b>

33
00:03:08.083 --> 00:03:12.583
<b>which will lead him away from </b>
<b>good and evil, towards liberation.</b>

34
00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:14.166
<b>Arjun is a warrior.</b>

35
00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:16.750
<b>Using the terminology of Arjuna himself,</b>

36
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:23.250
<b>Lord Krishna is also saying that the enemy within</b>
<b>you, is greater than the warriors in front of you.</b>

37
00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:27.000
<b>And that is doubt born out of ignorance..</b>

38
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.750
<b>Defeat the external enemies with weapons,</b>

39
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:35.708
<b>and cut down this inner enemy with </b>
<b>the sword of spiritual knowledge.</b>

40
00:03:35.708 --> 00:03:37.000
<b>Think about it,</b>

41
00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:41.041
<b>this point is not limited to just </b>
<b>Arjuna and the battlefield.</b>

42
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:44.250
<b>This applies to all of us as well.</b>

43
00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.458
<b>Remember, there must have been many times</b>

44
00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:49.125
<b>when we became discouraged,</b>

45
00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:52.083
<b>got stuck in the dilemma of </b>
<b>choosing the right option,</b>

46
00:03:52.083 --> 00:03:55.750
<b>or stopped before even starting on a new path.</b>

47
00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.166
<b>And now also consider,</b>

48
00:03:57.166 --> 00:04:00.500
<b>there were only two root causes for all of these –</b>

49
00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.458
<b>doubting our own abilities,</b>

50
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:06.750
<b>and confusion in the mind due </b>
<b>to lack of complete knowledge.</b>

51
00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:10.083
<b>The remedy for both will be the right knowledge.</b>

52
00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:17.875
<b>Spiritual knowledge will always help us </b>
<b>choose the right option and destroy doubt.</b>

53
00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:22.125
<b>Because if our real self is not this body,</b>

54
00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:25.291
<b>if we brought nothing and will take nothing,</b>

55
00:04:25.291 --> 00:04:29.791
<b>then what is loss and what is </b>
<b>victory in this material world? </b>

56
00:04:29.791 --> 00:04:33.833
<b>We simply have to dedicate both to Lord Krishna.</b>

57
00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:39.750
<b>Then by Krishna's grace, peace and joy </b>
<b>will be experienced automatically.</b>

58
00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:47.791
<b>In this fourth chapter,</b>

59
00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:52.500
<b>there was emphasis on spiritual knowledge, </b>
<b>on acquiring that knowledge,</b>

60
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:56.208
<b>and on the glory of the gurus.</b>

61
00:04:56.208 --> 00:04:57.583
<b>Because</b>

62
00:04:57.583 --> 00:05:01.416
<b>when many doubts arise in life,</b>

63
00:05:01.416 --> 00:05:11.583
<b>it is this knowledge that can cut those doubts </b>
<b>like a sword and remove them from your path.</b>

64
00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:14.875
<b>To move forward in life with firm determination</b>

65
00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:22.291
<b>and remove your doubts, adopt these</b>
<b>few practical measures:</b>

66
00:05:22.291 --> 00:05:26.125
<b>Remembering the principles again:</b>

67
00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:32.375
<b>Any knowledge takes time to find </b>
<b>a permanent place in the mind,</b>

68
00:05:32.375 --> 00:05:36.250
<b>so these principles will have to be </b>
<b>remembered again and again,</b>

69
00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.458
<b>they will have to be studied.</b>

70
00:05:38.458 --> 00:05:45.125
<b>Whenever doubt arises in the mind, </b>
<b>recall these principles once again.</b>

71
00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:49.833
<b>Regular meditation and self-reflection:</b>

72
00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:53.208
<b>Meditation brings concentration in a person,</b>

73
00:05:53.208 --> 00:05:57.750
<b>and self-reflection will keep giving you clarity </b>
<b>of your real spiritual self</b>

74
00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:03.041
<b>and the material nature of this world.</b>

75
00:06:03.041 --> 00:06:05.375
<b>The company of the guru:</b>

76
00:06:05.375 --> 00:06:10.750
<b>A person cannot look at their </b>
<b>every situation impartially.</b>

77
00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.125
<b>Especially in dire circumstances,</b>

78
00:06:13.125 --> 00:06:20.000
<b>consulting a guru or mentor will prove </b>
<b>to be extremely helpful.</b>

79
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.541
<b>Putting this knowledge into practice:</b>

80
00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:26.583
<b>Remembering this spiritual knowledge,</b>

81
00:06:26.583 --> 00:06:27.916
<b>self-reflection,</b>

82
00:06:27.916 --> 00:06:30.041
<b>consulting the guru, etc.</b>

83
00:06:30.041 --> 00:06:37.000
<b>will only be effective when you put this</b>
<b>knowledge into practice in your daily routine.</b>

84
00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:43.791
<b>You will follow the principles of spirituality </b>
<b>in your daily interactions with others.</b>

85
00:06:43.791 --> 00:06:48.666
<b>Collect your experiences:</b>

86
00:06:48.666 --> 00:06:52.958
<b>Regularly write down and </b>
<b>preserve your experiences.</b>

87
00:06:52.958 --> 00:06:59.416
<b>What was the dilemma, what steps did you take, </b>
<b>how did spirituality help? </b>

88
00:06:59.416 --> 00:07:02.916
<b>These very experiences will be </b>
<b>useful in the future as well,</b>

89
00:07:02.916 --> 00:07:10.708
<b>and to remember something, writing it </b>
<b>down proves to be extremely helpful.</b>

90
00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:15.333
<b>Sharing spiritual knowledge with others:</b>

91
00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:21.583
<b>Helping others and human welfare </b>
<b>is the focal point of spirituality.</b>

92
00:07:21.583 --> 00:07:26.208
<b>So if some knowledge or </b>
<b>experience has helped you,</b>

93
00:07:26.208 --> 00:07:28.916
<b>share it with others as well.</b>

94
00:07:28.916 --> 00:07:35.708
<b>This will help them too, and </b>
<b>your faith will also deepen.</b>

95
00:07:35.708 --> 00:07:43.791
<b>Keeping these few things in mind will </b>
<b>help in fully applying spiritual knowledge.</b>

96
00:07:43.791 --> 00:07:44.583
<b>And</b>

97
00:07:44.583 --> 00:07:51.166
<b>in any situation, this Gita is always </b>
<b>present for your help.</b>

98
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.708
<b>In today's modern age,</b>

99
00:07:58.708 --> 00:08:02.916
<b>everywhere, there is an abundance,</b>

100
00:08:02.916 --> 00:08:08.916
<b>an abundance of programs, suggestions, options.</b>

101
00:08:08.916 --> 00:08:10.500
<b>In such a situation,</b>

102
00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:17.291
<b>it is no surprise for someone's concentration </b>
<b>to be broken and to stray from the goal.</b>

103
00:08:17.291 --> 00:08:22.416
<b>Many kinds of doubts also arise in the mind.</b>

104
00:08:22.416 --> 00:08:26.250
<b>In such a situation, it becomes</b>
<b>necessary for the elders</b>

105
00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.375
<b>to keep the family united</b>

106
00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:36.833
<b>and create an environment where </b>
<b>everyone's spiritual foundation is strong.</b>

107
00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:39.833
<b>This will strengthen everyone's mindset</b>

108
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:45.375
<b>and prevent them from straying from the </b>
<b>path of goodness and purpose.</b>

109
00:08:45.375 --> 00:08:53.000
<b>To do this, strengthen family faith and </b>
<b>adopt these practical measures:</b>

110
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:57.125
<b>Assign a peaceful place in the house:</b>

111
00:08:57.125 --> 00:08:59.375
<b>As much as possible,</b>

112
00:08:59.375 --> 00:09:01.750
<b>create a place in the house</b>

113
00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:09.125
<b>where any family member can go and </b>
<b>peacefully meditate, pray, etc.</b>

114
00:09:09.125 --> 00:09:13.750
<b>Do collective study of holy scriptures:</b>

115
00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:19.458
<b>Regular study of the Bhagavad Gita </b>
<b>and other scriptures etc.</b>

116
00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:23.541
<b>will strengthen everyone's spiritual foundation.</b>

117
00:09:23.541 --> 00:09:27.583
<b>Dialogue on spiritual principles:</b>

118
00:09:27.583 --> 00:09:32.125
<b>The whole family will not only </b>
<b>study the scriptures regularly,</b>

119
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:33.166
<b>but</b>

120
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:37.708
<b>also allocate some time for discussion.</b>

121
00:09:37.708 --> 00:09:44.458
<b>This will be the time where family members </b>
<b>can have a dialogue on spiritual principles,</b>

122
00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:47.750
<b>resolve each other's doubts,</b>

123
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:54.250
<b>and try to remove each other's life difficulties.</b>

124
00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.958
<b>This will also increase family love.</b>

125
00:09:57.958 --> 00:10:02.375
<b>Make your conduct itself an example:</b>

126
00:10:02.375 --> 00:10:05.291
<b>The young learn from the elders,</b>

127
00:10:05.291 --> 00:10:13.666
<b>so as an elder of the family, keep peace, patience </b>
<b>and compassion in your every conduct.</b>

128
00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:17.500
<b>Your behavior will inspire others.</b>

129
00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:23.208
<b>Make community service a</b>
<b>regular goal of the family:</b>

130
00:10:23.208 --> 00:10:27.291
<b>Human welfare is also a part of spirituality.</b>

131
00:10:27.291 --> 00:10:33.083
<b>So it is necessary that you also participate in </b>
<b>community service, charity, etc.,</b>

132
00:10:33.083 --> 00:10:36.333
<b>and encourage others as well.</b>

133
00:10:36.333 --> 00:10:42.250
<b>Through these measures, not only will an </b>
<b>atmosphere of peace be created in the family,</b>

134
00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:47.375
<b>but everyone will also move </b>
<b>towards a purposeful life.</b>

135
00:10:47.375 --> 00:10:53.250
<b>This will bring both happiness </b>
<b>and prosperity in the family.</b>

136
00:10:58.125 --> 00:11:00.875
<b>In a professional organization,</b>

137
00:11:00.875 --> 00:11:03.708
<b>many people work together,</b>

138
00:11:03.708 --> 00:11:09.875
<b>everyone's culture is different, temperaments </b>
<b>are different, jobs are different;</b>

139
00:11:09.875 --> 00:11:15.916
<b>now in such a situation, it is very natural for </b>
<b>doubts and delusions to arise.</b>

140
00:11:15.916 --> 00:11:17.666
<b>But</b>

141
00:11:17.666 --> 00:11:23.291
<b>if this termite of doubt and </b>
<b>delusion is not destroyed,</b>

142
00:11:23.291 --> 00:11:28.041
<b>it can hollow out an organization from the inside.</b>

143
00:11:28.041 --> 00:11:37.875
<b>Imagine if employees doubt their senior</b>
<b>officials, doubt their colleagues,</b>

144
00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:45.666
<b>doubt a work process... all this </b>
<b>can be so detrimental.</b>

145
00:11:45.666 --> 00:11:50.000
<b>And for this reason, it is necessary</b>
<b>for senior officials</b>

146
00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:56.625
<b>to create an environment where </b>
<b>all people can speak openly.</b>

147
00:11:56.625 --> 00:12:01.708
<b>And every doubt can be ended </b>
<b>with the right knowledge.</b>

148
00:12:01.708 --> 00:12:07.333
<b>For this, it is extremely important to have </b>
<b>regular meetings with the employees.</b>

149
00:12:07.333 --> 00:12:10.833
<b>Some of these meetings can be public,</b>

150
00:12:10.833 --> 00:12:16.708
<b>where people can ask about any work process,</b>
<b>any goal of the organization,</b>

151
00:12:16.708 --> 00:12:19.250
<b>and clear their doubts.</b>

152
00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.041
<b>Some meetings can be personal,</b>

153
00:12:22.041 --> 00:12:27.875
<b>where employees can openly say things </b>
<b>that they cannot do publicly.</b>

154
00:12:27.875 --> 00:12:29.291
<b>For example,</b>

155
00:12:29.291 --> 00:12:35.875
<b>it could be about unethical activities</b>
<b>flourishing in some department.</b>

156
00:12:35.875 --> 00:12:40.708
<b>It is necessary for senior officials </b>
<b>to keep their ears open,</b>

157
00:12:40.708 --> 00:12:47.125
<b>so that they maintain a grip on the things </b>
<b>and activities going on in the organization.</b>

158
00:12:47.125 --> 00:12:50.041
<b>It is also necessary that senior officials </b>
<b>themselves</b>

159
00:12:50.041 --> 00:12:57.416
<b> become examples of the principles of patience and </b>
<b>peace in these group and individual meetings.</b>

160
00:12:57.416 --> 00:13:00.208
<b>When there is open communication</b>
<b>with everyone,</b>

161
00:13:00.208 --> 00:13:02.458
<b>everyone's doubts will be removed,</b>

162
00:13:02.458 --> 00:13:06.250
<b>then people will be able to </b>
<b>work well with each other.</b>

163
00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:11.125
<b>And when everyone moves together </b>
<b>towards the goals of the organization, </b>

164
00:13:11.125 --> 00:13:13.333
<b>the organization will progress,</b>

165
00:13:13.333 --> 00:13:16.958
<b>and so will the people working there.</b>

166
00:13:16.958 --> 00:13:21.208
<b>Reflect and act on this.</b>

